  "title": "检查数组对是否可被 K 整除",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-021",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "哈希表",
    "计数"
  ],
  "summary": "把偶数长度数组配成若干对，判断能否让每对元素和都被 k 整除。",
  "insight": "余数 r 只能与 k-r 配对；余数零必须有偶数个，当 k 为偶数时余数 k/2 也必须为偶数。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "负数余数要规范到零至 k-1",
    "互补余数频次必须相等",
    "自互补余数检查偶数性"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "complementary-remainder-counts",
      "title": "互补余数计数",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用模 k 频次验证所有配对需求。",
      "steps": [
        "count[normalized(value%k)]++",
        "count[0] 必须偶数",
        "对 r=1..k-1，若 r==k-r 则 count[r] 偶数，否则 count[r]==count[k-r]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n+k)",
        "space": "O(k)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/complementary-remainder-counts/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/complementary-remainder-counts/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/complementary-remainder-counts/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
